      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A railroad arrived in 1892, the Cape Girardeau and Northern, later renamed the Houck railroads, bringing commerce to Lithium.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
